title: Answering the Pogroms
card-image: img/cards/response_to_antisemitism.svg?v=2
subtitle: Respond to antisemitic attacks and smears.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: player_party = 'menshevik' and (response_to_antisemitism_timer <= 0)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; response_to_antisemitism_timer = 8

Many of the Menshevik leaders are Jews, and their enemies know it. Soldiers are told that the Soviet is run by Jews, pamphlets are circulated in the villages and, in 1919, the pogroms in Ukraine are the worst in a century.

- @confront: Confront it publicly, and name the authors.
- @ignore: Say nothing; it would only draw attention.
- @protect: Organise defence and relief for the victims. (1 resource)
- @easy_discard

@confront
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 0, -6);
RO.boost(Q, {soldiers: -1, peasants: -1});
RO.add(Q, {right_threat: -1, rel_ally: 1});
!}

A public declaration named the authors and the printers of the smears. The Black Hundred press replied with more of the same.

@ignore
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 0, 6);
RO.boost(Q, {soldiers: 1});
!}

We said nothing. Some members of the Bund have said that they will remember it.

@protect
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no resources.
on-arrival: {!
RO.pay(Q, 1);
RO.fac(Q, 'bund', 2, -10);
RO.boost(Q, {nations: 3, workers: 1});
RO.add(Q, {rel_ally: 1});
!}

Self-defence units and a relief fund for the victims. The Bund is grateful, and so are many who are not Jews.
